# Runtime-heavy data/outputs: present on disk (shipped by deploy rsync), not in git.
# A fresh clone needs these copied from the Mac deploy dir (or the ECS /srv/waterexpert-agent).
#
# Anchored, because these two patterns are unanchored by default and were
# swallowing ``src/water_ai/data/`` — the loader package itself. That is the
# exact package whose absence crashed every agent start before 2026-09-09, and
# it was being kept out of git by the rule meant to protect the datasets.
/data/
/outputs/
.swap_backup*/
